#. module: physical_therapy
#: model:crm.stage,name:physical_therapy.stage_lead4
msgid "Active Patients"
msgstr "ຄົນເຈັບທີ່ກໍາລັງປິ່ນປົວ"

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add an upfront payment in your Appointment Type."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການຊໍາລະເງິນລ່ວງໜ້າໃນປະເພດການນັດໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add the Subscription App and invoice automatically based on a subscription "
"type."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແອັບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ ແລະ ອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມປະເພດການສະໝັກ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"All emails sent and received are automatically recorded in the "
"<strong>Chatter</strong>, giving you a clear history of your communication "
"with the patient. Once the patient books an appointment, it is automatically "
"synchronized across CRM, Appointments, and Calendar, keeping your schedule "
"up to date without manual work."
msgstr ""
"ອີເມວທັງໝົດທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບ ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ <strong>Chatter</strong> ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຊ່ວ"
"ຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນປະຫວັດການຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບຄົນເຈັບຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ. ເມື່ອຄົນເຈັບຈອງນັດໝາຍແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກົງກັ"
"ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດລະຫວ່າງ CRM, ການນັດໝາຍ, ແລະ ປະຕິທິນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຕາຕະລາງຂອງທ່ານອັບເດດຢູ່ສະເໝີໂດຍບໍ່"
"ຕ້ອງເຮັດເອງ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"As you review her needs, you move the opportunity to Qualified, indicating "
"that a consultation is required."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານກວດສອບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງລາວແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍ້າຍໂອກາດໄປທີ່ຂັ້ນຕອນ ມີຄຸນສົມບັດ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງວ່າຈຳເປັນ"
"ຕ້ອງມີການປຶກສາ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid "Auto-post your invoice on a regular basis."
msgstr "ລົງບັນຊີໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເປັນປະຈຳ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Automated recurring invoicing with the <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Subscription App</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ການອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນແບບປະຈຳອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັ"
"ບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ</font></strong>."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Be careful, using the \"Log Note\" in your contact will be displayed only "
"for you and your eventual team. If you select the \"Send message\" option, "
"this will notify your customer (which can be really interesting also)."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ, ການນຳໃຊ້ \"ບັນທຶກຂໍ້ຄວາມ\" ໃນລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນສະເພາະທ່ານ ແລະ ທີມງານຂອງທ່"
"ານເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ \"ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ\", ລະບົບຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຍັງລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ (ເຊິ່ງອາດມີປະໂ"
"ຫຍດຫຼາຍເຊັ່ນກັນ)."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid "Block time slots for treatments or personal availability"
msgstr "ລັອກຊ່ວງເວລາສຳລັບການປິ່ນປົວ ຫຼື ເວລາສ່ວນຕົວ"

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model:mail.template,name:physical_therapy.booking_suggestion
msgid "Book your next appointment"
msgstr "ຈອງນັດໝາຍຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By doing this, the corresponding time slots are automatically reserved and "
"will no longer be available on the public booking link, ensuring your "
"availability remains accurate."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຮັດແບບນີ້, ຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກຈອງໄວ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ຈອງໃນລິ້ງສາທາລະນະອີ"
"ກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າເວລາຫວ່າງຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By installing this package, you gain access to a set of essential "
"applications, including CRM, Appointments, Calendar, and Invoicing, allowing "
"you to focus on patient care while Odoo handles your daily operations."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດນີ້, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ່າງໆເຊັ່ນ CRM, ການນັດໝາຍ, ປະຕິທິນ, ແ"
"ລະ ການອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສຸມໃສ່ການດູແລຄົນເຈັບ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ Odoo ຈັດການວຽກງານປະຈຳ"
"ວັນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few contacts."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໂມດູນນີ້ແລ້ວ, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຈະມີລາຍຊື່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ຕົວຢ່າງເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid "Cancel a session"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກຮອບການປິ່ນປົວ"

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model:crm.stage,name:physical_therapy.stage_lead3
msgid "Consultation"
msgstr "ການປຶກສາ"

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a dedicated <strong>knowledge article</strong> for each patient to "
"track progress, exercises, or treatment plans"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ <strong>ບົດຄວາມຄວາມຮູ້</strong> ສະເພາະສຳລັບຄົນເຈັບແຕ່ລະຄົນ ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ, ທ່າອອ"
"ກກຳລັງກາຍ, ຫຼື ແຜນການປິ່ນປົວ"

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Create a professional <font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><strong>Website</"
"strong></font> for your practice and allow patients to book appointments "
"online."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ <font class=\"text-o-color-1\"><strong>ເວັບໄຊ</strong></font> ແບບມືອາຊີບສຳລັບ"
"ຄລີນິກຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເປີດໃຫ້ຄົນເຈັບຈອງນັດໝາຍຜ່ານອອນລາຍ."

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid "Discover more about Odoo by diving into our"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ Odoo ໂດຍສຶກສາຈາກ"

#. module: physical_therapy
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:physical_therapy.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"During or after a therapy session, you can easily record clinical notes:"
msgstr ""
